  "intent": "Extends the return-aware seed by adding a small positive weight for cluster_density, rewarding candidates that are centrally located among unvisited cities. This encourages compact tours by prioritizing nodes with many nearby unvisited neighbors, while preserving the original bias toward candidates with larger return distance.",
